From 333c6f457e9e67f4f688b497cac25689be83b5c2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Evgeny Vereshchagin <evvers@ya.ru>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 14:35:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] common: bail out of service_name_join when snprintf fails or
 truncates the result

It fixes a bug where it was possible for unprivileged local users to
crash avahi-daemon via D-Bus by calling the
ResolveService/ServiceResolverNew methods with bogus service names:
```
d=$(python -c 'print(".".join([r"\\032"*62]*4))')
gdbus call --system --dest org.freedesktop.Avahi --object-path / --method org.freedesktop.Avahi.Server.ResolveService -- -1 -1 aaaaaaaaa _http._tcp "$d" -1 0
```
avahi-daemon crashed with
